The legal texts are laws of the Kingdom of Bhutan, as published (English PDFs) by the Office of the Attorney General in
its Depository of Laws (https://oag.gov.bt/?page_id=7854).

Section 7 of the Copyright Act of the Kingdom of Bhutan, 2001 provides: "Notwithstanding the provisions of Sections 5
and 6, no protection shall extend, under this Act, to ... b. any official text of a legislative, administrative or
legal nature, as well as any official translation thereof." The texts are therefore free of copyright; they are
copied here unaltered apart from layout, with attribution to the Office of the Attorney General.

